      "writtenOn": "2023-07-17T14:47:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dimensions can be negative here to designate a \"fully-lazy\" proxy, whose dimensions will only be known at instantiation.\n\nWith that in mind, maybe too-large dimensions are ok here since for all lazy proxies the actual texture still needs to be instantiated by the client, and a failure there (during a replay) won\u0027t be as catastrophic as a failure during a snap? And we can\u0027t validate dimensions at this point for fully-lazy proxies anyways.",
      "parentUuid": "14fb8971_aa0fe1f5",
      "revId": "531bf47c9a5d90a41de9cfe81f6e0d413043e383",
